==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 31.67 seconds<sup>950f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Angel]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**10 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**5 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
**10 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**15 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**20 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**20 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns.
**2 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A majority of major threats here are Floating, which means [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] does well to counter the Doge Base on its own. Use Nukers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to kill the Brollows without letting them rebound. Outside of this, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can quickly dispatch the Li'l Bun and Mr. Angels, while [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] does good supplemental damage to everything here and stays behind Octopus. On crowned difficulties, A [[talents|talented]] Awakened Bahamut Cat + Octopus/[[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]] combo can let you rush the base (which takes damage from [[Explosion]]s)

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-00]]: Very useful in this stage, since it resists Floating and Angel enemies (which are the main threats here), while also blocking any Wave Attacks. If you don't have her, other units that are [[Resistant]] to Floating or Angels like [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kai μ]] (As long as you have a cat that can quickly deal with the Mr. Angels) and [[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|Guardian Gamereon]] can work to defend your cats and prevent the enemies from rushing to your base.

